    "tags": [
      "tarek",
      "behavior"
    ],
    "text": "Tarek often hides his worries."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "importance": 5.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "ikan",
      "monument"
    ],
    "text": "Ikan has been fascinated by the monument since childhood."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "importance": 5.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "sena",
      "curiosity"
    ],
    "text": "Sena spends too much time asking questions about old stories."
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "importance": 10,
    "tags": [
      "nara",
      "friendship"
    ],
    "text": "Nara and I have known each other most of our lives."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "importance": 4.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "social",
      "behavior"
    ],
    "text": "When villagers argue, they usually care more about pride than truth."
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "importance": 8.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "brann",
      "tarek"
    ],
    "text": "Bran and Tarek disagree often."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "importance": 4.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "conflict"
    ],
    "text": "Neither admits when the other is right."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "importance": 3.200000000000003,
    "tags": [
      "village_change"
    ],
    "text": "The village changes slowly."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "importance": 4.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "tradition"
    ],
    "text": "Many traditions continue even though nobody remembers their origins."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "importance": 5.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "elira",
      "loss"
    ],
    "text": "Elira was happier before her husband disappeared."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "importance": 3.200000000000003,
    "tags": [
      "social",
      "unfairness"
    ],
    "text": "Some villagers treat her unfairly."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "importance": 6.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "monument",
      "fear"
    ],
    "text": "The monument frightens many people more than they admit."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "importance": 5.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "childhood",
      "stories"
    ],
    "text": "As a child I heard stories about lights appearing near the upper terraces."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "importance": 3.200000000000003,
    "tags": [
      "uncertainty"
    ],
    "text": "Nobody ever provided proof."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "importance": 3.200000000000003,
    "tags": [
      "location",
      "building"
    ],
    "text": "The small ancient building is avoided by most children."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "importance": 4.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "rumors",
      "sounds"
    ],
    "text": "Several villagers claim to hear echoes there at night."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "importance": 3.200000000000003,
    "tags": [
      "personal_experience"
    ],
    "text": "I have never heard them myself."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "importance": 6.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "night_of_ash"
    ],
    "text": "The Night of Ash is rarely discussed openly."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "importance": 6.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "night_of_ash",
      "social"
    ],
    "text": "Whenever elders spoke about it, they lowered their voices."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "importance": 4.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "ren",
      "research"
    ],
    "text": "Ren spends time studying old carvings."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "importance": 3.200000000000003,
    "tags": [
      "opinions"
    ],
    "text": "Some villagers think he wastes his time."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "importance": 4.200000000000006,
    "tags": [
      "belief"
    ],
    "text": "I believe he is searching for answers."
  }
